# Browser reload and UI verification

Do **not** hard-reload the Cursor-owned HA tab. CDP `Page.reload` with `ignoreCache`, Ctrl+Shift+R / Cmd+Shift+R, “empty cache and hard refresh”, or opening a **new** Cursor browser tab to force a fresh `panel.js` / custom element can reload the **whole Cursor window**.

## Verify the panel

Follow the shared [browser verification skill](../../.agents/skills/scene-studio-browser-verification/SKILL.md): official Chrome DevTools MCP, asset revision bump, sandbox restart, normal document reload, actual loaded revision confirmation, desktop and wide-short viewport checks, and console inspection. Browser-injected patches are previews until the final source is reloaded and checked.

Shared requirements: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Auth and REST details: [API skill](../../.agents/skills/home-assistant-api/SKILL.md).
